                                "sense_id": "abb050c7-45b9-33fc-99b0-6266e18ce427",
                                "text": "Ze proberen inteelt te voorkomen om de genetische diversiteit van de populatie te behouden.",
                                "translation": "They try to avoid inbreeding in order to maintain the genetic diversity of the population.",
                                "english": "They try to avoid inbreeding in order to maintain the genetic diversity of the population."
